Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.56,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(394,235)}NobitaLand, the City of Dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.56,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(364,529)}Brought to you by: Ko-Fi..me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.98,0:00:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.15,0:00:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.86,0:00:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, very good There. there..
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.69,0:00:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.53,0:00:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, don't drop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.54,0:00:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Who in their right mind would play on skating board inside house?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.42,0:00:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But skating outside is more dangerous than inside...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.13,0:00:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,True...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.13,0:00:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna get hit, foolish kid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.02,0:00:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, What happened, Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.06,0:00:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to play inside home once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But my mum is hosting a tea ceremony gathering with her friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.11,0:00:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So she told me to go out & play.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.32,0:00:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.87,0:01:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful! Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.41,0:01:03.75,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(438,74)}Under construction
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.41,0:01:03.75,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(526,484)}No Entry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.21,0:01:06.67,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fs11\pos(580.444,40)}Under construction
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.21,0:01:06.67,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos(598.578,180.889)}No Entry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? When did this get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.58,0:01:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So we can't play? Tell me why!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.71,0:01:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you undestand by seeing with your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.59,0:01:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They're going to construct, so it's no entry zone, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.13,0:01:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.72,0:01:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then where are we supposed to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.47,0:01:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You didn't have to hit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.39,0:01:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.73,0:01:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.19,0:01:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,An exclusive house...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.94,0:01:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,An exclusive city...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.36,0:01:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Where I can freely do anything I wish...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.74,0:01:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I want such city where I can do anything I want to, without getting scolded by others!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.45,0:01:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A independent city, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.87,0:01:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's construct one!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.16,0:01:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? Are we going to construct such a city?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.17,0:01:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,First let's re-make our own house.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.76,0:01:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Polaroid Instant Mini footage Camera!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.14,0:02:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,First shoot a photo...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.26,0:02:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,then print it...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.76,0:02:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Pour some water on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.60,0:02:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for a few secs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.86,0:02:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, it's all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.23,0:02:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,A mini house, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.49,0:02:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, everything is made in detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.70,0:02:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's just a tiny toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.62,0:02:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No worries, we just have to shrink!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.70,0:02:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.54,0:02:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.54,0:02:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Enter this "Gulliver's Tunnel"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.09,0:02:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,See? I shrank.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.84,0:02:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.35,0:02:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, you too enter the Gulliver's tunnel and come inside this mini house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.31,0:02:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make lot of buildings!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.45,0:03:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, now the city has become lively.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.08,0:03:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can organize whatever and however we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.09,0:03:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,A very tiny book!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.17,0:03:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The words written are the size of ants.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.51,0:03:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about the residents of each buildings?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.51,0:03:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, they won't be present in the shots I took.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.89,0:03:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a street here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.43,0:03:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But no traffic lights and zebra crossing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.39,0:03:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make a bowling gym and a baseball field.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make a video game corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.48,0:03:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, click more shots while I'm away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.61,0:03:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,, I'll bring my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.45,0:03:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so grinning while we're feeling bored?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.62,0:03:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.32,0:03:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, today I'll make your dreams come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.00,0:03:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt that he's just sleep talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.79,0:03:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay if it was a bluff!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.34,0:03:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the entry point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.13,0:04:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fool us! How can we enter this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.68,0:04:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,OMG!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.28,0:04:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,it's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.28,0:04:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make this our city.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.43,0:04:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,ouch, it hurts
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.81,0:05:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us join!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.11,0:05:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,if you eat too much Dorayaki, you will have a stomach-ache, Dora-{\i1}chan{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.86,0:05:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,give me the toy model
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.74,0:05:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Get whatever you want, suit yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.58,0:05:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been dreaming to be laying down on the street and sleep like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.21,0:05:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I am tired of playing so I'll read a Manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.05,0:05:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is having fun of playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.38,0:05:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's call this place NobitaLand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.06,0:05:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,it's Mum
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There is so much junk here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.41,0:05:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a small warehouse here, please construct it for me. Will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes Ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.67,0:06:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end for NobitaLand!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.46,0:06:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Doraemon. Please pull out a gadget which could make some ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.92,0:06:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I beg of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.97,0:06:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay a hard price, if you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.72,0:06:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's just impossible to make up some ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.31,0:06:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, quickly clear up all this junk at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.93,0:06:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.02,0:06:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.27,0:06:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on! That's not fair!
